#: DarzasClient/DarzasDominion/Darza/Game/UI/Desktop/Tooltips/DesktopPetCustomizationPageTooltip.cs
msgid ""
"<c#0xffff77>Pet Customization<c/> activates token affixes while a pet is equipped.\n"
"\n"
"<c#7CF7FF>Flow:<c/>\n"
"1) Pick a pet.\n"
"2) Assign tokens to slots.\n"
"3) Click <c#9DFF8C>Confirm Changes<c/> to apply.\n"
"\n"
"<c#FFD98A>Token slots:<c/> Locked and non-interactive without a pet. Equip a pet first to configure and activate them.\n"
"\n"
"<c#FFD98A>Slot 3 unlock:<c/> Character-specific. Use <c#8EF3FF>1 Pet Unlock<c/>, pay <c#F6CA00>299 Gold<c/>, or pay <c#CFD8DC>5,000 Silver<c/>.\n"
"\n"
"<c#7CF7FF>Pet Unlocks:<c/> Shown in the left currency panel and consumed only when you choose that option.\n"
"\n"
"<c#FFB4A2>Rules:<c/> Duplicate pet-affix categories are blocked across active slots.\n"
"\n"
"<c#FF1E14>Consumable tokens are consumed on confirm.\n"
"All purchases are non-refundable.<c/>"
msgstr ""

