"<c#0xffff77>Shields<c/> are account-wide cosmetics shown next to your name and in chat.\n"
"\n"
"<c#7CF7FF>Shield Ranks:<c/> Which shield you show depends on your Shield Rank, the claims of your Shield attainments. A pack has one for each rank and Ruby, and Equip puts one in its rank's slot.\n"
"\n"
"<c#FFD98A>Display Shield Slot:<c/> Shows one shield of your choice instead: any pack shield up to your rank, or an Other shield you own. Pick it, and press Display.\n"
"\n"
"<c#FF1E14>All purchases are non-refundable.<c/>"
