#: DarzasDominion/DarzaGameServer/Logic/Data/Event/ValentineBehaviors.cs
msgid "Aphrodite, my heart's delight, this place has changed- it's lost its light."
msgstr "Afrodite, luz do meu coração, este lugar mudou- perdeu seu clarão."

